ps - what is running

SYNOPSIS
    ps [-T] [-a] [-l]

DESCRIPTION
      -T   threads as well as processes
      -a   everybody's, not only yours
      -l   the job and login columns: PGID and SID

    A thread is a task here, so it appears as one. A process is a task whose
    pid and tgid are the same; -T shows the rest.

SEE ALSO
    kill, jobs, taskman
